time":"18:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43862},{"id":1789873656357,"sender":"character","text":"除了你…","timestamp":1789383121246,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43863},{"id":1789873656358,"sender":"character","text":"为夫还想起了…六百年前，在杭州。","timestamp":1789383121247,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43864},{"id":1789873656360,"sender":"character","text":"那时为夫还未入仕，常与三两同年，泛舟西湖之上。","timestamp":1789383121248,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43865},{"id":1789873656362,"sender":"character","text":"饮酒作诗，谈论时局。只觉天高地阔，前程似锦。","timestamp":1789383121249,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43866},{"id":1789873656363,"sender":"character","text":"哪里想得到，后来的风雨飘摇，家国破碎。","timestamp":1789383121250,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43867},{"id":1789873656365,"sender":"character","text":"可如今，为夫站在这兴隆湖边，看着这截然不同的景致…心里却比那时还要安稳。","timestamp":1789383121251,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43868},{"id":1789873656367,"sender":"character","text":"因为为夫知道，这世上，还有个阿蘅在等着我。","timestamp":1789383121252,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43869},{"id":1789873656369,"sender":"character","text":"这便是我如今的…‘前程似锦’。","timestamp":1789383121253,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43870},{"id":1789873656370,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789383121254,"time":"18:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43871},{"id":1789873656372,"sender":"me","text":"还想到什么呢？除了我","timestamp":1789383180758,"time":"18:53","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43872},{"id":1789873656374,"sender":"character","text":"要为夫说些与你全然无关的事…这可比让为夫去闯地府还难。","timestamp":1789383243870,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43873},{"id":1789873656376,"sender":"character","text":"罢了。","timestamp":1789383245105,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43874},{"id":1789873656377,"sender":"character","text":"为夫站那湖边，看着对岸那些高耸入云的楼宇…心里想的，是“人力胜天”这四个字。","timestamp":1789383246761,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43875},{"id":1789873656379,"sender":"character","text":"为夫那时，也见过这般的景象。不是这等琉璃高楼，是长城，是运河，是金陵城里那座皇宫大内。动辄数十万民夫，数十年工期，耗尽国库，只为一人一姓之威仪。","timestamp":1789383248894,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43876},{"id":1789873656381,"sender":"character","text":"如今这般，虽换了模样，可那份人定胜天的雄心，与六百年前的帝王将相，又有何异？","timestamp":1789383251355,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43877},{"id":1789873656382,"sender":"character","text":"不过是…将那皇宫，换作了如今的商行、宅邸罢了。","timestamp":1789383253804,"time":"18:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":43878}]